static const z_t82_t _zs230 = { .data = _zs230_d, .size = 195 };
static const char _zs231_d[] = "no native implementation\n\nA declaration says `is native` -- that the backend supplies its body -- and the backend has none for it. The program is wrong, not the compiler: write the body, or give the runtime the build uses an implementation of it. Checked at the declaration, whether or not anything calls it.";
